 the first half as anticipated."]},{"type":"p","children":["In Functional Ingredients \u0026 Solutions, demand for natural preservation solutions in the Food business remained healthy, and Biochemicals continued its strong growth trajectory from H1. In Health \u0026 Nutrition, Nutrition delivered strong growth, supported by very strong volume/mix growth. Higher fish oil prices contributed to increased omega-3 DHA prices in the quarter positively impacting the mix component in the strong volume/mix result in the segment."]},{"type":"p","children":["Adjusted EBITDA margins improved strongly in the quarter, supported by ongoing cost-reduction initiatives, operational efficiencies, and higher omega-3 DHA prices. We also delivered strong free cash flow generation, demonstrating the quality of our earnings and the strength of our business model."]},{"type":"p","children":["While the process to sell our interest in the TotalEnergies Corbion joint venture attracted interest from potential buyers, the proposals we received did not adequately reflect the business’s value, strategic position, and long-term potential. We have therefore concluded that continuing to develop the business is the best way to maximize shareholder value."]},{"type":"p","children":["Based on our strong year-to-date performance and visibility into the fourth-quarter orderbook, we maintain our full-year 2026 guidance.”"]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Attachment"]}]},{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=nVmt9INN4zy75kHVS7tgpWQgFpuhbDdHLoaaYl5ql_xwqrVGOKLLLjXT9BkvWO8iSYxlFjOUHIOCJk7dgk3dffdP6nmm_LV1OGLGKcSstKgtq1VJ41FKT2niypr6Wj4al6-5b0mY7ZkeK0oi41QROeMunZvg590oiVg0DwboRNSEsUkgCsYZ3AsOIM2f5bxMKkf3udE-6NzU2b-7NYb81Q==","linkText":"2026-10-28_Corbion_Press-release_Q3 2026"}}]}]}]},"language":"en","tags":[{"title":"Dutch stocks","args":[{"id":"category","value":"stock"},{"id":"market_country","value":"NL"}]},{"title":"Earnings","args":[{"id":"section","value":"earnings"}]},{"title":"GlobeNewswire","args":[{"id":"provider","value":"globenewswire"}]}],"robots":["noindex"],"id":"globenewswire:6bec01bf3094b:0","title":"Corbion delivers strong volume-led sales growth and significant margin improvement in Q3; full-year guidance maintained","published":1793167200,"urgency":2,"link":"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/10/28/3389864/0/en/corbion-delivers-strong-volume-led-sales-growth-and-significant-margin-improvement-in-q3-full-year-guidance-maintained.html","relatedSymbols":[{"symbol":"EURONEXT:CRBN","logoid":"corbion","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"corbion"}}],"storyPath":"/news/globenewswire:6bec01bf3094b:0-corbion-delivers-strong-volume-led-sales-growth-and-significant-margin-improvement-in-q3-full-year-guidance-maintained/","read_time":100,"provider":{"id":"globenewswire","name":"GlobeNewswire","logo_id":"rdp-gnw","url":"https://www.globenewswire.com/"}}